# Documentation & Markdown rules:
# Exclude ALL .md, .doc, .docx, .txt, .pdf files EXCEPT README.md
*.md
**/*.md
!/README.md
!README.md
*.doc
*.docx
*.txt
**/*.txt
*.pdf
**/*.pdf
*.rtf
*.odt

# Allow project documentation media
!docs/
!docs/**

# Temporary diagnostic logs
*.log
